# Day 35 – Build Prompt Puzzle 🧩

## Challenge
Today I built a **Prompt Puzzle** application using Claude AI.

This project transformed Prompt Engineering into an interactive game where users learn by solving prompt-building challenges instead of reading traditional tutorials.

---

## What I Learned

### 🧩 Prompt Building
- Understand the importance of Role
- Add proper Context
- Define Constraints
- Use clear Formatting

### ⚡ Prompt Optimization
- Remove vague instructions
- Eliminate unnecessary words
- Make prompts more specific and effective

### 🤖 Output Comparison
- Compare weak prompts with optimized prompts
- Observe how prompt quality directly impacts AI responses

### 🎮 Gamified Learning
- Learn Prompt Engineering through interactive puzzles and challenges
- Improve prompting skills by practicing instead of memorizing

